1
00:00:20,284 --> 00:00:22,582
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:38,113 --> 00:00:43,530
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,608 --> 00:00:46,913
=Episode 13=

4
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:53,759
Haotian.

5
00:00:55,079 --> 00:00:56,000
Haotian.

6
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:05,280
Su Qinglan is finally out of the way.

7
00:01:06,159 --> 00:01:06,959
Haotian.

8
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:09,015
Hurry and make Lin Lulu cheat.

9
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:10,318
The bigger the scandal, the better.

10
00:01:10,560 --> 00:01:12,000
Something feels wrong.

11
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:15,400
You've been getting more
and more irritable.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,120
You're not usually like this.

13
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,319
Did something happen?

14
00:01:23,439 --> 00:01:24,200
Nothing.

15
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,760
I just want to get this over
with sooner.

16
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,000
Then we can finally relax.

17
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:35,840
Haotian.

18
00:01:36,079 --> 00:01:36,536
Baby.

19
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,719
I have something urgent to deal with.

20
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,000
Haotian...

21
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:51,959
80 million.

22
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:54,040
You actually borrowed 80 million?

23
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,200
Say it.

24
00:02:03,265 --> 00:02:04,106
What happened?

25
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:06,536
(Load-Side Water Separator)

26
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,480
An... investment...

27
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,735
It was making huge profits at first.

28
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:13,280
That's why I took out a high-interest
loan to make a big score.

29
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:18,976
Don't you know what I do?

30
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,680
Chen Ping.

31
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,976
You're always so careful.

32
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,735
How could you fall into

33
00:02:21,759 --> 00:02:23,000
such an obvious trap?

34
00:02:24,376 --> 00:02:27,400
I looked into that investment company
at first.

35
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,199
I made sure there was nothing
wrong before I...

36
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,520
I don't want to hear another word.

37
00:02:33,997 --> 00:02:35,159
Haotian.

38
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,199
Tomorrow is the final
repayment deadline.

39
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,415
If I can't pay it back,

40
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:40,175
I'll lose my hand.

41
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:41,055
I won't even be able to operate anymore.

42
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,175
We can't touch the money set aside
for the scheme.

43
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,639
Tomorrow is the final payout day!

44
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,735
Don't panic!

45
00:02:45,759 --> 00:02:46,135
Yes, yes.

46
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:46,976
That money can't be touched.

47
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,319
Not a cent.

48
00:02:51,159 --> 00:02:52,759
Lin Lulu hasn't been herself lately.

49
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,360
She won't be spending much.

50
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:57,080
I'll use that money to cover your loss.

51
00:03:00,039 --> 00:03:01,360
Thank you, Haotian.

52
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,560
I'll go with you.

53
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:09,936
I want to see

54
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,159
who could fool Chen Ping

55
00:03:11,439 --> 00:03:12,879
and who this person really is.

56
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,560
Together?

57
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,536
Go!

58
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,479
Let's go.

59
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:17,280
Let's go.

60
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,579
One, two...

61
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:26,759
- Three, four.
- Three, four.

62
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:29,400
- Five, six, seven, eight.
- Five, six, seven, eight.

63
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,170
- Two, two, three...
- Two, two, three...

64
00:03:31,171 --> 00:03:31,400
Four.

65
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,000
Yes.

66
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:34,280
Five, six, seven, eight.

67
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:39,120
Five, six, seven, eight.

68
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:39,599
Head.

69
00:03:39,759 --> 00:03:41,000
Your head, look over.

70
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,096
When you do this,

71
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:42,719
your head should turn.

72
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,879
Look toward that direction.

73
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:47,319
Then follow your gaze downward.

74
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,000
Yes, let your eyes reach
your fingertips.

75
00:03:49,192 --> 00:03:50,568
Okay, do that again.

76
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,599
- Let me take a look.
- (Jiang Lai.)

77
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,000
(I can tell you with confidence,)

78
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,919
(the trap I've set for Zhang Haotian
is complete.)

79
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,199
(And it is foolproof.)

80
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:01,400
(So you don't have to be strong
on your own.)

81
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:03,879
(Go do what you truly love.)

82
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,879
This porridge is for your recovery.

83
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:08,919
Ms. Zhao specifically asked me
to prepare it.

84
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,520
Thank you.

85
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,575
That's all for today's lesson.

86
00:04:12,599 --> 00:04:13,639
I'll get going.

87
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,439
Registration for the Benesh Dance
Competition is open.

88
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,399
Jiang Lai.

89
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,920
Let's give it everything we've got.

90
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,160
Focus on your preparation first.

91
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,560
The trap you set for Zhang Haotian...

92
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,120
Can you tell me a little about it?

93
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,920
I set up a shell investment company.

94
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:41,040
Then created a high-profit project
tailored to them.

95
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:44,439
I took advantage of Chen Ping's
desperation to make money

96
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:47,839
and lured him into borrowing 80 million
from his company.

97
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:49,839
Now that the debt is due,

98
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,399
this huge sum of money

99
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:53,839
has trapped Chen Ping completely.

100
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,920
You're forcing Chen Ping to go
to Zhang Haotian

101
00:04:58,240 --> 00:05:00,399
and forcing Zhang Haotian
to pay to save him?

102
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,720
Zhang Haotian values money
above everything.

103
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:06,319
80 million could kill him.

104
00:05:06,839 --> 00:05:08,920
But like I told you,

105
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,560
this is just an appetizer.

106
00:05:11,306 --> 00:05:13,028
(Please try again later.)

107
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,399
It's just a repayment.

108
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,600
Why does this feel like
some underground deal?

109
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:34,040
Who exactly are we dealing with?

110
00:05:37,319 --> 00:05:38,279
I don't...

111
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,439
You're still stuttering at a time
like this?

112
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,336
I don't know

113
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:45,240
who owns that investment company

114
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:46,776
or who they

115
00:05:46,800 --> 00:05:47,600
really are.

116
00:05:48,759 --> 00:05:50,016
Even this location

117
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,519
was given to me by someone else.

118
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:56,199
I don't have the leverage to negotiate.

119
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,439
What time is the meeting?

120
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,199
Eight.

121
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:03,920
And they're late.

122
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:52,199
It's been ten years.

123
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:55,279
I didn't expect you to recognize me
at a glance.

124
00:06:57,199 --> 00:07:00,000
Looks like this dog's memory

125
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,199
is pretty good.

126
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:08,959
Your delivery.

127
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:18,399
My son is sick.

128
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:23,000
How about you compete against him
in my son's place?

129
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:24,439
If you win,

130
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,240
you get ten thousand yuan.

131
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,319
Did you hear me?

132
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,319
Money is right in front of you,

133
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,000
and you still won't take it?

134
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,240
No, no.

135
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,480
That's more like it.

136
00:07:50,839 --> 00:07:52,240
Mr. Wang is so fair.

137
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,079
He won't let dogs bully people,

138
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,336
or people bully dogs.

139
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:56,600
Of course.

140
00:07:58,879 --> 00:07:59,399
Come on.

141
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:00,680
Three.

142
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:03,199
Two.

143
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,519
One.

144
00:08:05,600 --> 00:08:06,079
Run!

145
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:13,879
Pay up.

146
00:08:13,903 --> 00:08:14,567
What money?

147
00:08:14,959 --> 00:08:15,600
Ten thousand.

148
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,439
Hand it over.

149
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:19,160
Take it and get lost.

150
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,399
Someone called me a few days ago,

151
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:39,240
saying tonight's prey would excite me.

152
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:42,039
At first, I didn't believe that person.

153
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:43,600
But now,

154
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:47,639
I'm excited!

155
00:08:49,639 --> 00:08:52,279
I made you my dog back then.

156
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,159
And I can do the same now.

157
00:08:57,264 --> 00:08:59,264
(One Blow After Another)

158
00:08:59,664 --> 00:09:03,769
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

159
00:09:04,577 --> 00:09:07,389
♪I should forget you♪

160
00:09:07,858 --> 00:09:12,935
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

161
00:09:12,959 --> 00:09:14,799
♪To carry on♪

162
00:09:15,055 --> 00:09:19,912
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

163
00:09:20,278 --> 00:09:22,166
♪You no longer have the strength♪

164
00:09:24,465 --> 00:09:27,346
♪You want me to go there for you♪

165
00:09:28,914 --> 00:09:34,352
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

166
00:09:34,946 --> 00:09:38,085
♪Your freedom♪

167
00:09:38,785 --> 00:09:43,216
♪Has become my cage♪

168
00:09:44,144 --> 00:09:49,935
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

169
00:09:51,286 --> 00:09:57,136
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

170
00:09:57,599 --> 00:10:03,546
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

171
00:10:03,826 --> 00:10:07,076
♪You told me♪

172
00:10:07,473 --> 00:10:11,979
♪I would shine like a star♪

173
00:10:12,823 --> 00:10:17,456
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

174
00:10:17,456 --> 00:10:21,020
♪How to live without you♪

175
00:10:21,239 --> 00:10:27,064
♪I look up at the starry sky♪

176
00:10:28,585 --> 00:10:32,369
♪So hazy and blurred♪
